---
// KaTeX stylesheet for the SSR math markup emitted by renderInlineMath().
//
// Self-hosted on purpose: importing the CSS from the installed `katex` package
// (a theme-utils dependency) lets Astro bundle it — always the SAME version as
// the SSR markup, with the fonts, and no offline breakage. The previous
// hardcoded CDN `<link>` (a pinned version + SRI) silently drifted when katex
// was bumped: KaTeX requires the CSS to match the markup version, so the
// mismatch could break rendering, and the SRI meant it never self-corrected.
//
// Themes render <KaTeXLink /> in <head>; it emits no element — Astro injects the
// bundled stylesheet from this import.
import "katex/dist/katex.min.css";
---
